<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 4 Best in Slot Gear list for Blood Death Knight DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Icecrown Citadel, Trial of the Crusader, and Ulduar. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Blood Death Knight DPS in Phase 4</h2>There's a few things we want to pay attention to and stick to. We want to maintain our Spell Hit cap, we want to maintain our Expertise soft cap, and we want as close to 100% Armor Penetration as possible. We'll be able to achieve all of this through gear and gems. <br/>
<br/>
