<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hand options for Blood Death Knight DPS in Phase 4</h3>Every slot we've been pretty much chasing Armor Penetration here, and this one is no different. The thing is, our tier in this slot doesn't have it. So we have some flexibility to look elsewhere. Sadly, none of the plate gloves at a high ilvl have it, which makes us look at other pieces. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50977/gatecrashers-gauntlets">
